window.products.push({"id":204012,"name":"ARTLEO Ice Cube Maker Trays for Freezer with Lid and Storage Bin, Easy Release 55 Mini Nugget Ice Cubes Trays 2 pack with Cover, Ice Holder, Scooper, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T9B6wHaaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy Release Ice Cube Trays for Freezer: Made of highly-elastic plastic with smooth surface, Flexible and Durable. Ice cubes release easily with just a twist, effortless! You can empty the tray immediately after take it out from the freezer. The silicone ice cube trays can not pour all cubes at a time. Ice Cube Tray with Lid: The lid keeps ice fresh and sanitary by preventing ice from absorbing freezer odors. The lid and The edges of the tray are designed higher for easy filling and easy transporting, not easy to spill. (note: not sealed). Smooth surface makes it easy to clean! Strong & Safe Freezer Tray: Made of food-grade material, Bpa-free, no smell, no greasy film floating, safe for your family! ARTLEO 55 mini ice cube trays and bin use better materials and designs to make them stronger and more durable. They can withstand long-term low-temperature storage without breaking! of course please don't overfill. 55 Small Ice Maker Molds: 2 trays makes 110 mini ice a time, and the ice bucket can holds 2 trays. 2 trays allow you to replace at any time, wash and dry one at any time. These mini ice cubes are widely used for Cocktail, Coffee, perfect for Ice Crushers, use for a protein shake and smoothie, perfect size for ice chewer. Stackable Ice Trays with Bucket: The ice trays lids can stack more trays, save a lot of space. Product includes: 2 ice cube trays with lid, 1 storage container, 1 scooper. The stacked size is 10.6(L) x 6.7(W) x 4.7(H) inches, fits nicely in RV refrigerator and Home Fridges. Service: If damaged received or cracked in use, Free replacement without returning. Just feel free to contact us immediately! we will resolve it within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T9B6wHaaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTLEO","source_asin":"B0C414MJBL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C414MJBL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C414MJBL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
