window.products.push({"id":204025,"name":"Grelife Evaporative Air Cooler, Portable Cooling Fan with 75° Oscillating, Humidifying, 1.58Gal Water Tank, 4 Ice Packs, Remote Control, 3 Speeds, 12H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714pubbQWaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Efficient Air Cooler] With remote controller and touch screen, easily adjusting the modes, speeds and timer by a simple click or tap; Maximum 12hours timing, no worries about forgetting to turn it off; you may enjoy the cool breeze in your home with Grelife Evaporative Air Cooler anytime. [3 In 1 Portable Air Conditioner] Grelife Evaporative Air Cooler offers 4 ice boxes and is equipped with the newest evaporative cooling technology to cool down your area without drying the air like traditional A/C; To cool and humidify your surrounding off in the most comfortable and fastest way. No more hot and dry in this summer. This portable air cooler can be used as a regular fan without water running. [Ultra-quiet & Energy Saving] Thanks to the ultra quiet spinning fan engine, the noise of this air cooling fan is lower than 50 dbs, which is considered whisper-quiet. With 65W rated power, no installation needed it reduces your bills by 80%, no damaging refrigerants, no vent needed, let this small air conditioner fan cools you and adds moisture to air-reducing dry air symptoms such as itchy eyes, throat, or skin in dry climates. [Top Refilling & Big Water Tank] Tired of bending over and adding water frequently? Our portable air conditioning fan is designed with easy top refilling which is friendly to the elder and disable person, besides, the bottom 6L (1.58 Gallon) big capacity water reservoir allows this evaporative cooler run up to 12hours after full refill. [Easy to Move & Maintain] Comes with 4 universal wheels which allows you easily take it to any rooms, no extra installation needed, plug and play.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714pubbQWaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grelife","source_asin":"B0B55QB6XN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B55QB6XN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B55QB6XN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
