window.products.push({"id":204178,"name":"YBM HOME Mesh Basket Utensil Holder & Picnic Silverware Caddy Organizer with Four Compartments and Napkin Storage, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1RepT1lHPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hold the most indispensable utensils and condiments in style with this mesh utensil and condiment caddy The Essentials Held At Your Fingertips The YBM Home Utensil Caddy and Napkin Holder is the perfect addition to the kitchen to serve and display your everyday utensils in an organized pattern. This attractive mesh cutlery caddy offers a distinct approach to cluttered silverware drawers by keeping your flatware upright and readily available. Designed with one large and three small compartments with a handle to move it from place to place, this caddy is also multi-purpose to hold appetizing sauces for hot dogs, seasonings for BBQ, cups, bottles; we’ve seen it used to store office supplies, classroom supplies, beauty products, personal care products, crafts, gadget accessories, coffee/tea/hot chocolate bags. The sky's the limit. Excellent for Indoor and Outdoor Entertaining Without any distinction, this decorative tabletop accessory infuses aesthetically with any kitchen setting. If you are hosting a cookout in your backyard, this caddy conveniently makes things easy to carry altogether from the kitchen to the patio. For camping trips, fill it up with tomato bottles, mayonnaise, and disposable flatware for easy meal preparation. Attractive Design Upscale the Looks of Your Dining Table This caddy is made with high quality stainless steel and silver coating finish for a modern blending statement. The sturdiness and smart craftsmanship ensure long lasting durability. Measures approximately 7 in. W x 9.25 in. L x 4.375 in. Depth. Hosting large parties? Add multiple caddies for convenience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1RepT1lHPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YBM HOME","source_asin":"B097J348ZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097J348ZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097J348ZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
