window.products.push({"id":204229,"name":"Budth Electric Lunch Box, Portable Food Warmer for Car, Truck, Office, 12V 24V 110-230V 70W Adapter, Leak Proof, 304 Stainless Steel Container, SS for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GAtjDCHNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WARM HEALTHY MEAL ANYWHERE: Always on the GO and tired of cold or fast food? The BUDTH electric heating lunch box perfectly solves this problem. Plug it in, reheat your food and enjoy a homemade meal. You can reheat your food at the office, shares workplaces, in the car, in trucks, or even a dorm room. DESIGNED SPECIFICALLY FOR BIG APPETITES: Do you find that your current lunchbox is too small? The capacity of our portable food warmer is over 7.5 cups (1.8L and 20% more than the competitive models). Our complimentary stainless steel fork and spoon are also 30% larger, allowing for more comfortable eating. Our products are especially suitable for more substantial means. Don't worry that the person you care about will not have enough to eat if you prepare their meal in our reheatable lunchbox. HEATS UP QUICKLY : Ditch that long line at the microwave & wait time at your desk. Our electrically heated lunch boxes can heat food in as little as 15 minutes at room temperature. (Please note that if your food is taken directly out of the refrigerator, the reheating time will be more than 45 minutes. Please plan in in advance for the best experience.) EASY TO CLEAN: You only need to clean the stainless steel inner tray after use and wipe down the outside of the lunch box. The inner tray is dishwasher safe and high temperature resistant. LEAKPROOF: We’ve added a sealing ring and improved the cover design, ensuring the cover will not move during transpiration, making your food more securely covered. LARGE CAPACITY: The capacity of our lunch box is (mover 7.5 cups (1.8L), and the capacity of other models is about 6.3 cups (1.5L). Our forks and spoons are much larger than others offered. ENHANCED 3 IN 1: Independent interface design, safe and durable. Supports household 110V-220V voltage, truck 24V voltage and car 12V voltage. ENHANCED 3 IN 1: Independent interface design, safe and durable. Supports household 110V-220V voltage, truck 24V voltage and car 12V voltage. PERFECT GIFT: A perfect gift for your husband, wife, boyfriend, girlfriend, father, mother, sibling, friend or even yourself - it’s great for anyone who wants to enjoy a warm meal and save money on takeout. WHAT YOU WILL GET: 1x electric lunch box, 1x larger stainless steel spoon & fork, 1x additional plastic compartment, 1x 12/24V power cord for cars/trucks, 1x 110V/220V power cord for home/office/Construction site, 1x 2.0L capacity thermal Insulated Bag with internal pocket zipper to store the power cords.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GAtjDCHNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Budth","source_asin":"B09S9PML3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S9PML3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S9PML3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
