window.products.push({"id":204234,"name":"Tovolo Better Batter Tool™ - Stratus Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-02XmXT-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Tovolo Better Batter Tool is the answer to all of your batter challenges! It is ideal for stirring sauces, mixing batter or gravy, and even breaking up ground meat. The thick blades mix the ingredients quickly to avoid over-beating which produces a lighter, fluffier cake. The 12.5″ Better Batter Tool has tapered silicone fins to scrape the sides of the bowl clean, so there is no need for a separate spatula. The silicone head has a long-lasting, stain-resistant color and is heat resistant to 600 degrees F, so this tool works great for cooking on the stovetop as well. It has a stylish 18/10 stainless steel handle and is dishwasher safe for easy cleaning.  At Tovolo, we believe time spent cooking should be fun and we are honored to be a part of that experience in each home that uses our products. We challenge ourselves to improve the performance, function, and appearance of kitchen tools. Something as simple as a silicone spatula moves us to create the perfect experience for our customers. We obsess over every detail to ensure that our spatula will outperform expectations. However, performance alone is not enough; we want to put a smile on the customer’s face as well. Whether it is our Spatulart silicone spatulas, our assortment of frozen pop molds or our whimsically shaped ice molds, we strive to add a colorful element of fun to each of our items, to do just that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-02XmXT-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B004Q3QULK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004Q3QULK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004Q3QULK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":204235,"name":"Nut Milk Bag Cheese Cloths for Straining Reusable 4 Pack 4\"x6\" Cold Brew Coffee Bags Unbleached Organic Cotton Cheesecloth Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WTscVHfJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NATURAL ORGANIC COTTON - Our organic cotton nut milk bags are made of 100% natural organic cotton , woven to an extremely high standard of quality & durability. These nut bag will offer us a safe and healthy choice, and our ultra fine mesh bags even filters the smaller particles, bring you with a supremely smooth and satisfyingly silky food. PERFECT DESIGN AND SIZES:100% organic cotton nut milk bags in one set, they are durable, high quality and reusable. Came with 2 size to satisfy your needs. 4\"x6\"*2 as soup bags, 4\"x6\" for cheese making, nut milk making, fruit juice making. This set contains all you need. GREAT FILTERABILITY: Our strainer made of durable line material have good permeability, high infiltration rate and clean filtration. It squeezes out the liquid more quickly and easily, output smoothly nut milk without impurities. EASY TO WASH: The cheesecloth bag is easy to wash. You just need to turn the bag inside out, wash it by running water with soap, then hung it to dry. You can also dip the bag into boiling water to boiling it for health. Please make sure the bag already cooled down to room temperature before use! QUALITY AFTER-SALES SERVICE - Our fine organic cotton straining bags are made to ensure You'll Love It! If you have any problems, please don't hesitate to contact us, our friendly customer service will do our best to solve your problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WTscVHfJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Noctiflorous","source_asin":"B08ZYCW8Y6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZYCW8Y6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZYCW8Y6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":204236,"name":"James Corwin Western Bison Buffalo Rustic Bed Quilt Set w/ 2 Shams (King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dIFUc8OXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Outer Shell 100% Microfiber Polyester. Filling 70% Cotton 30% Polyester. Top Quality 3-Piece Luxury Quilt Set: includes 1 quilt and 2 bonus shams. Bedspread set features a unique stippling pattern stitch and design. Soft Warm & Comfortable all season quilt set. Lightweight for year round use, great for layering. High-quality 220 GSM 70% cotton 30% polyester fill and 100 GSM polyester cover. Includes Two BONUS Shams Easy Care & Easy Wash: Machine washable warm, tumble dry low, warm iron if needed. Durable, high-quality material designed to last.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dIFUc8OXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"James Corwin","source_asin":"B0844V4D9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0844V4D9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0844V4D9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":204237,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld Electric Whisk - Portable Multifunction Stainless Steel Coffee Frother with Spoon Easy Use & Clean Drink Mixer Milk Foam Maker f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+GtS6-g0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Good Assistant for breakfast and afternoon tea - This compact and portable handheld milk frother can be used to make frothed milk. This is the electric drink whisk mixer that coffee lover must have anyway. The high speed upgraded motor boasts enough power to create foamed milk within 20 seconds, so you can make the Lattes, Cappuccinos Macchiato and Hot Chocolate at home The easy solution to your family's breakfast needs - In the morning, you can use a frother handheld to whip up your eggs and make a delicious scrambled egg. Then use the coffee frother to make frothy coffee or hot chocolate to wake up your body. Motor So Pro - When making cakes for your children or family, use the electric whisk to easily whip the egg whites, stir in the butter and sugar and whip the cream to make making cakes and desserts easier for you. The frother whisk has silent motor turning at high speed and barely makes a sound. This handheld froth maker can do wonders both in your home kitchen or in your bar, office, camping or traveling, serve your guests the best latte macchiato, with the most luscious, silky froth! High Quality you can trust - We only use high quality materials in our electric milk frother. The foam rod is made of high molecular polymer and has a high-quality texture with wood grain coating.. The non-slip surface enables you to grip the drink mixer firmly when you activate it, so that even children can easily grasp it. The detachable stirring head is made of food-grade quality stainless steel and is easy to clean High-quality Gift - The handy and practical Portable milk frother is absolutely perfect as a gift for friends, family and colleagues, especially milk and coffee lovers who enjoy mixing coffee and milk themselves. We attach great importance to the customer experience, If you are not 100% satisfied with our products, please feel free to contact our customer service, We will provide the best solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+GtS6-g0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOOS DOLISMA","source_asin":"B0B561CN6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B561CN6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B561CN6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
