window.products.push({"id":204249,"name":"LUXOME Luxury 15lb Weighted Blanket | Includes Removable Lyocell from Bamboo/Minky Cover | Full Size | 54\"x72\" | Cool & Cozy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519e5Iw+IsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"REVERSIBLE COVER INCLUDED: The cool bamboo lyocell side is perfect for warmer nights, while the ultra-plush minky side is so cozy you'll never want to get out of bed! All of our fabrics are superior to other blankets. The bamboo is 300TC Lyocell from bamboo. Our minky is 195 GSM, much more soft & velvety compared to cheaper minky blankets. HIGHEST QUALITY INNER BLANKET: The inner weighted blanket is 100% percale cotton (233TC) vs. most other blankets that use polyester or the cheapest cotton. Using fewer, higher-quality layers makes it breathable, durable, machine washable, and comfortable to use even without the cover. NO WEIGHT BUNCHING: This is the #1 complaint from our customers who bought a cheap weighted blanket before trying ours. We spent a lot of time designing a blanket that prevents the beads from bunching within the pockets and the blanket from bunching within the cover. PERFECT WEIGHT: All of our blankets are optimized to an ideal weight per square foot based on user testing, not based on the inaccurate percent of body weight model. Just select a size and you can rest assured it’s the perfect weight. USA COMPANY & SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We are a midwestern company that LOVES our customers and pride ourselves on values, quality, and service. Try our blankets for up to 30 days and if you aren't satisfied for any reason we'll provide fast, friendly service and a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519e5Iw+IsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUXOME","source_asin":"B08695HF2B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08695HF2B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08695HF2B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":204250,"name":"Home Essentials & Beyond Del Sol Impressions Ice Cold Beverage Dispenser Jug 1 Gallon Clear Bail & Trigger With Locking Clamp Drink Dispenser With Eas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jqwc4Bb9L._AC_SL1107_.jpg","description":"GLASS ENABLES THE COLOR OF THE BEVERAGE TO SHINE Made of glass enabling the color of the beverage to shine. Glass enhances and preserves the beverages aromas and flavors unlike plastic and acrylic dispensers. Great for Any Event, Durable for Daily Use. Strong Sturdy High Quality and Stylish. Shaped to perfection. Base provides maximum stability. Ideal for all types of cold beverages. Perfect Gift Idea. GREAT FOR PARTIES, JUST ADD SOME ICE TEA MIX, SAVE MONEY ON BOTTLED DRINKS. Breakthrough styling and unmatched brand value. Elegant look and adds to any table's aesthetics with their contemporary design. Increase the overall drinking experience and is strongly recommended by health experts. Design: Designed to be sleek and modern while still looking traditional. The glass has a dispenser for containing the mess while looking sharp for any occasion. They are ready for your home or commercial use at work, restaurants, events, and parties. Functionality: Perfect for ice tea lemonade and more. Many customers use the mason glass dispenser at events and parties for some really great ideas like: iced tea iced tea lemonade lemonade ice coffee ice coffee Hand wash cold water only Casual Entertaining These Beverage dispensers are perfect for casual entertaining. The spigot is easy to use so even the kiddos can grab a glass of lemonade","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jqwc4Bb9L._AC_SL1107_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Essentials & Beyond","source_asin":"B00CHQS3U4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CHQS3U4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CHQS3U4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
