window.products.push({"id":204634,"name":"Microtex innovation- Set of 2 Throw Pillows with Stuffing Included, 18x18 Bed Pillows, Filled Embroidered Accent Cushions for Home Décor, Filling 100%","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512kczo8c4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Want to make your couch or bed look more luxurious? An empty bed, couch, or chair can look dull and drab if you don’t decorate it. This can heavily affect our room's overall aesthetic and ruin a good look. Because of this, embellishing our furniture with the right accents pillows and décor is essential to make our place look better and more comfortable. If you want to give life to your furnishings, adding an elegant throw pillow might be the solution. These cushions are not only stylish but also provide extra comfort and support. So, if you want to start decorating your place with soft decorative pillows, we have just the right set for you. Upgrade your home’s aesthetic with the Microtex MicroSuede Throw Pillow! When it comes to adding a bit of flair and elegance to our space, throw pillows for bedroom can be a big help. Our 18x18in cushion come in an embroidered faux suede fabric case that looks extremely fancy. Each set of 2 soft decorative pillows for living room is available in pumpkin, brick, lipstick, wheat, navy, and deep sand colors, which can complement any upholstery. What's great about these cushions is that they also provide extra comfort for you and your guests. Thanks to its soft but firm polyester filling, you'll be able to enjoy added support whenever you're chilling in your bed, sofa, couch, chair, futon, patio, or even on the floor! Once your pillows get dirty, you can pop them in the washer and dryer for an easy cleaning experience. You can also remove small stains by rubbing the surface with baby wipes. Just make sure not to use bleach. If you're trying to collect dust or hair strands, you can use a vacuum or a lint roller. Still not convinced? Here are more reasons to get this pillow: ✅ Lightweight and portable ✅ 100% hypoallergenic ✅ Perfect housewarming gift","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512kczo8c4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Microtex innovation","source_asin":"B08X4Y8TDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X4Y8TDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X4Y8TDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
