window.products.push({"id":204686,"name":"Dash DCAF250GBBK02 Aircrisp® Pro Compact Air Fryer + Oven Cooker with Temperature Control, Non Stick Fry Basket, Recipe Guide + Auto Shut Off Feature,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hykGCl2ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A more compact version of our AirCrisp Pro Air Fryers, this 2 Qt Air Fryer is perfect for cooking single servings of delicious, crispy fried food with none of the added fat! AirCrisp technology uses hot air to cook instead of oil, so there’s none of the mess of a traditional deep fryer. The removable Crisper Basket is nonstick and easy to clean, and the Air Fryer is compact, storing easily on a shelf or right on the countertop. Perfect for french fries, chicken nuggets, wings, fried veggies, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hykGCl2ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DASH","source_asin":"B08XN7WSGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XN7WSGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XN7WSGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":204687,"name":"NOVIS Vita Juicer The 4-in-1 Juicer, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41z3u5ExcvL._AC_.jpg","description":"A world first in the field of juicers. The Novis Vita Juicer, combines four functions in a single unit: Juicing, Pressing, Pureeing and Vitatec ( A combination of centrifuge & citrus press). The Novis Vita Juicer is a premium multi-functional product developed in Switzerland for a natural and healthy lifestyle. Its high-quality manufacturing, innovative technology, product design as well as the responsible use of materials make the Novis Vita Juicer a world first in the field of kitchen appliances. This multifunctional juice is characterized by the following product advantages. Multifunction. Centrifuge, citrus press, puree/smoothie function, Vitatec Vitatec. Thanks to the innovative combination of citrus press and centrifuge, noticeably more nutrients remain in the juice, which also has a wonderfully smooth consistency. (patent-protected) Citromax. Engages the citrus press to yield maximum extraction of juice with pulp from oranges, limes, lemons, grapefruit with no effort. (Patented) Drophold. This simple, easy-to-operate spout prevents the flow of juice and any drips. Easy cleaning. All of the parts that come into contact with the juice can be easily removed and cleaned in a dishwasher. In particular, the centrifuge can be easily dismantled into two parts for quick rinsing and washing - an absolute world first. Widest feed chute. Thanks to its special design, fruit and vegetables can be fed into the centrifuge very easily, without any effort, unlike conventional juicers. The unique cutting disc pulls in fruit and vegetables and cuts and shreds them, generating maximum juice extraction. Auto speed. The Novis Vita Juicer has only one switch (On/Off). This intelligent device regulates the speed and power, and reacts automatically to different pulp consistencies, without having to be adjusted manually. The Novis Vita Juicer comes in a variety of beautiful, vibrant colors. Product Dimensions: 8.6\" L x 9.0\"Wx 16.9\"H.Weight is 16.5 lbs. Warranty 10 years on the motor, 3 years on the parts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41z3u5ExcvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVIS","source_asin":"B014XR6Y46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014XR6Y46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014XR6Y46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
