window.products.push({"id":204757,"name":"Seta Direct, Bamboo Flat-Weave Sun-Filtering Roll Up Blind (24x66 Inch, Espresso)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oqx0BdAES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a brand new flat slat flat-weaved bamboo window blind. The bamboo slats were closely knitted overlapping each other so minimal sunlight would pass through. This provides more privacy than the traditional bamboo blinds. It comes with a simple installation instruction manual and hanging hooks. During outdoor usage, hang in well-ventilated area which the blind could dry completely after rain. Remove bamboo blind from outdoor or screen in porch when night time humidity is high to avoid mildew as this blind is composed of natural untreated bamboo. If used under high humidity environment, please consider applying spray-on fungicide. This is a corded blind. In order to ensure safety for children and pets, please install the child safety cord cleats at least 6 feet (72 inches) above floor level. Do not leave cord hanging at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oqx0BdAES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seta Direct","source_asin":"B093LFWD67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093LFWD67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093LFWD67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":204758,"name":"INA KI Natural Marble Lazy Susan Rotating Serving Plate 12 Inches ( Gold Foiling )","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516-xfljEhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lazy Susan may not be technically a professional cake maker’s turntable, but it is something that many people might have at home. With the tool, you may explore the culinary art of making cakes if you are a beginner, as it helps you smoothen the frosting and give the desired finishing touch to your dessert in a neat, clean and effortless manner. Now you may wonder what type of Lazy Susan to get especially when you have just started baking. The answer is – the cool, classy marble. Yes, you read it right. The natural stone is one of the most suitable materials for a Lazy Susan. Not Just a Turn Table, it’s Multifunctional Find out some fun ways to take your Lazy Susan from the kitchen counter all the way to your living room:  Display Your Treats: Present food on your INA KI Lazy Susan on that special dinner for your ‘special’ guest. The surface cooler serves as a classy turntable to display your baked delights, cheese, desserts and afternoon snacks.  Gather Your Spice Jars: Gathering your oils, salt, herbs and the pepper mill on the Lazy Susan sounds like a smart idea, especially when you are busy in the kitchen and want everything at arm’s length.  Great Help for Cabinet Storage: Apart from keeping it alongside your cooktop, you can also place the Lazy Susan on your pantry to store away your seasoning canisters on it.  TV Or Monitor Base: You read it right. Since the Lazy Susan is made of solid and durable marble, it can withstand the weight of your LED/LCD TV or monitor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516-xfljEhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INA KI","source_asin":"B09HSDCBTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HSDCBTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HSDCBTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
