window.products.push({"id":204851,"name":"Halo UNSC Footlocker Foldable Storage Chest | Fabric Basket Container, Cube Organizer With Handles | Collapsible Black Cubby Cube, Closet Organizer | ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LgwXnnpcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPARTANS CAN KEEP THEIR QUARTERS ORGANIZED Get your own standard-issue UNSC trunk without having to go through Spartan training. This officially licensed HALO Footlocker Foldable Storage Bin will keep you organized ahead of your next mission. Place this storage bin at the end of the cot in your quarters, keep it in the barracks to store your combat armor and civilian clothes, or leave it in your gaming space to corral the mess before inspections. WHERE HOME DECOR MEETS FANDOM Unlike a real UNSC footlocker, this cube organizer is lightweight, portable, and collapsible. This versatile piece of home decor allows you to efficiently organize your essential belongings in true military fashion. Combining style and function, the divider provides a strategic solution to maintain an orderly space and reduce clutter. Even better, you can conveniently fold up this cube organizer whenever you don't need it. This will help you maximize valuable space in your quarters. You can also gather 'round it for an impromptu poker game in your downtime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LgwXnnpcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ukonic","source_asin":"B092TB23L8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092TB23L8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092TB23L8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":204852,"name":"Medium 2-screw replacement handle for vintage Revere Ware pans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616uDo3sDUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Restore your vintage Revere Ware with these replacement 2-screw handles from RevereWareParts!  These are MEDIUM sized replacement handles for vintage era Revere Ware pans. They fit some Revere Ware sauce pans and skillets made between the early 1940's and 1968 that have two screws through the opposite ends of Bakelite part of the handle.  Please see the sizing instructions included in the photos to determine if this handle is the proper size for you.  IMPORTANT DETAILS  - Each package comes with the two handle halves and replacement hardware. - The handles are made from Bakelite and the hardware is stainless steel. - The screws and nuts are not interchangeable with original Revere Ware hardware - Handles are 4.6 in long, 2.6 in between holes on center, and fit a 5/8 inch metal spline. - Don't over-tighten the screws as Bakelite can be brittle.   FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS  Are the handles oven safe?  No, the handles are not safe to use in an oven.  Are the handles dishwasher safe? Repeated washing in a dishwasher will dull the finish of Bakelite handles.   Will these handles fit any other cookware brands? These handles are made only for the specific Revere Ware types above and will not fit any other types or brands of cookware.   What other Revere Ware replacement parts are available? We also sell a number of other replacement parts made for Revere Ware cookware. You can find our complete list of items available on Amazon.com by clicking on our name under the Buy Now button and selecting the Products tab.  TROUBLESHOOTING  If you are unsure if these handles are the correct ones for you, have problems with installation, or need any other help, please don’t hesitate to contact us. Just click on our name under the Buy Now button and then use the Ask a Question button on our seller page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616uDo3sDUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RevereWareParts.com","source_asin":"B001TZ762U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-204852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001TZ762U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001TZ762U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
